OL,3,GNEWSAOverturned lorry's loaf load
OL,4,Acausing delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn overturned lorry which spilled its
OL,7,Fload of bread and other baked goods
OL,8,Facross the A1(M) is causing delays for
OL,9,Fdrivers.
OL,11,FAll lanes were closed between junctions
OL,12,F60 and 61, at Bowburn, south of Durham,
OL,13,Fafter the Warburtons HGV overturned,
OL,14,Fflattened the central reservation
OL,15,Fbarrier and "shed its load" across both
OL,16,Fcarriageways at about 05:14 GMT, Durham
OL,17,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
