OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOverturned lorry's loaf load
OL,4,Acausing delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said the driver of the lorry
OL,7,Fwas taken to hospital, while a full
OL,8,Fclosure of the northbound carriageway
OL,9,Fbetween Bowburn and Carville
OL,10,FInterchange remains.
OL,12,FThe southbound carriageway has been
OL,13,Frestricted to the hard shoulder only,
OL,14,Fwith motorists advised to seek
OL,15,Falternative routes.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
